WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:01.800
- 'Cause you grew up,
not just in the South,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.100
you grew up in the Deep South, right?

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.050
- Oh, I grew up in the dirty dirty.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.670
There's the dirty South,

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:06.980
and then there's the dirty dirty

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.183
which is where I'm from in Mississippi.

00:00:08.183 --> 00:00:09.699
- Yes, yes, I love it.

00:00:09.699 --> 00:00:11.380
I grew up in the South as well.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.373
How hard was that growing up

00:00:12.373 --> 00:00:14.970
in that kind of environment being gay?

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:15.810
- It was really hard.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.640
- Could you come out then
or did you have to wait?

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.100
- I had to wait honestly.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.449
I grew up in a conservative Christian,

00:00:21.449 --> 00:00:24.460
ultra ultra red part of the state

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.120
and it was really hard for me

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.570
to kind of come to grips with that

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:29.580
but I was blessed with
a really loving family

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.200
and it wasn't easy for them at first

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.580
but we all navigated it together

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.150
and came out a stronger family
on the other side of it.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.030
- That's so cool

00:00:37.017 --> 00:00:38.121
That can be hard.

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.480
'Cause I'm from the South,

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.580
from an ultra Christian community as well.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:42.720
So I had friends that,

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.930
I always like asking people
in the limelight about that

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:48.640
because a lot of people don't
have the confidence to do that

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:49.960
so that's why I always ask people,

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.770
like how did you do it
or when did you do it.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:54.040
- I think we're seeing a new South emerge

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.420
and I credit people like you, honestly.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:59.330
I've always appreciated your
support of the LGBTQ community,

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.330
I loved your Tie It Up music video

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.620
where you have gay couples getting married

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.470
along side straight couples in this video

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:07.647
and just showing that love
is love is love, right?

00:01:07.647 --> 00:01:09.717
- Love is hard, you know what I'm saying,

00:01:09.717 --> 00:01:11.349
like even if you,

00:01:11.349 --> 00:01:13.210
just what I say.

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:15.360
Love is hard enough to find

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.343
so when you find it who the
hell cares what it looks like.

00:01:18.343 --> 00:01:20.747
If you're the same or different.

